<Paragraph>Hey y’all,<Br /><Br />Welcome to Growth Circuit :) We’re Nick and Lucy.<Br /><Br />You’re on the list for our NYC event picks: public talks, demos, meetups, and our own gatherings for people building things in marketing, growth, and AI.<Br /><Br />Here’s how it works: find something interesting in the newsletter, get to know the group on WhatsApp, then meet us at an event.<Br /><Br /><Link href="https://growthcircuit.club/apply?path=nyc&amp;source=newsletter&amp;utm_source=loops&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=newsletter_welcome">Apply to join the NYC WhatsApp community</Link><Br /><Br />We review applications and send the invite after approval. Group members can see your phone number, so joining is optional.<Br /><Br />You can also <Link href="https://growthcircuit.club/events?utm_source=loops&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=newsletter_welcome">browse upcoming events</Link> and come along before joining the chat.<Br /><Br />See you soon!<Br />Nick &amp; Lucy</Paragraph>
